# .gitignore -- Mighty Networks + HubSpot DM integration
# Author: Jibril Sulaiman · Created: 2026-09-28 (trimmed 2026-10-01)
# Why: this repo is public. A Mighty refresh token can read and send a real
# person's private messages, and exported sheet tabs hold member emails and DM
# text, so none of them may reach history. Once pushed, a secret is compromised.

node_modules/
.env
.env.*
*.token
*secret*.json
*.csv
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
